            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "What Disney's OpenAI partnership could mean for ads",
            "description": "<p>Disney (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DIS\">DIS</a>) will be making a $1 billion equity investment into OpenAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>), reaching an agreement to become the first major content licensing partner with the artificial intelligence firm's Sora AI video-generating platform.</p>\n<p>MNTN (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MNTN\">MNTN</a>) CEO Mark Douglas reacts to this news and how this type of AI content could change the marketing landscape and how ads are used.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/asking-for-a-trend/\">Asking for a Trend</a>.</p>",
